rança | CredMaisPay</title>\n    \n    \n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" crossorigin=\"\" href=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/assets/index-BTl9H9xn.css\">\n  ","body":"\n    <div id=\"root\"><div class=\"site-shell \"><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#conteudo\">Pular para o conteúdo</a><div class=\"scroll-progress\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"brand\" aria-label=\"CredMaisPay, início\" translate=\"no\" href=\"/\" data-discover=\"true\"><img class=\"brand-wordmark\" src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/brand/credmaispay-wordmark.png.webp\" alt=\"CredMaisPay\" width=\"620\" height=\"166\" loading=\"eager\"></a><nav class=\"main-nav\" aria-label=\"Navegação principal\"><a class=\"\" href=\"/emprestimos\" data-discover=\"true\">Empréstimos</a><a class=\"\" href=\"/conta\" data-discover=\"true\">Conta</a><a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"active\" href=\"/seguranca\" data-discover=\"true\">Segurança</a><a class=\"\" href=\"/ajuda\" data-discover=\"true\">Ajuda</a><a class=\"\" href=\"/blog\" data-discover=\"true\">Blog</a><a class=\"mobile-access-link\" href=\"/login\" data-discover=\"true\">Acessar conta</a></nav><div class=\"header-actions\"><a class=\"text-link desktop-only\" href=\"/login\" data-discover=\"true\">Acessar</a><a class=\"button button-small\" href=\"/emprestimos#como-funciona\" data-discover=\"true\">Simular crédito <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><button class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-label=\"Abrir menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></header><main id=\"conteudo\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><section class=\"security-editorial-hero\" data-cm-hero=\"true\"><div class=\"security-editorial-art\"><img src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/security-hero-relatable-v3.webp.webp\" alt=\"Mulher brasileira de cabelo cacheado em um ambiente azul e acolhedor\" width=\"1877\" height=\"838\" fetchpriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\"></div><div class=\"security-editorial-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow dark\"><span></span> SEGURANÇA CREDMAISPAY</p><h1 data-cm-hero-title=\"true\">Proteção forte.<br><em>Informação clara.</em></h1><p data-cm-hero-text=\"true\">Tecnologia, autonomia e comunicação para ajudar você a reconhecer e proteger cada movimento.</p><a class=\"button button-dark\" href=\"/ajuda\" data-discover=\"true\" data-cm-hero-button=\"true\">Ver orientações <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"product-ribbon ribbon-mint\" aria-label=\"Destaques do produto\"><div class=\"product-ribbon-track\"><div class=\"product-ribbon-group\" aria-hidden=\"false\"><span>CredMaisPay</span><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Acesso protegido</div><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Alertas contextuais</div><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Autonomia no app</div><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Orientação direta</div></div><div class=\"product-ribbon-group\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>CredMaisPay</span><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Acesso protegido</div><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Alertas contextuais</div><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Autonomia no app</div><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Orientação direta</div></div></div></section><section class=\"feature-intro is-dark\" data-cm-section=\"original-1\"><div class=\"feature-media \" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.111409px);\"><img src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/security-feature-relatable-v1.webp.webp\" alt=\"Homem brasileiro em casa, representando autonomia e segurança financeira\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" loading=\"eager\" data-cm-image=\"true\"><span>01</span></div><div class=\"feature-copy\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.556084px);\"><p class=\"eyebrow light\"><span></span> CAMADAS DE PROTEÇÃO</p><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Segurança que trabalha junto com você.</h2><p data-cm-text=\"true\">Recursos de autenticação, alertas e monitoramento compõem uma experiência feita para prevenir e informar.</p><ul><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Alertas para reconhecer movimentações</li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Controles disponíveis no ambiente digital</li></ul><a class=\"button button-light\" href=\"/ajuda#contato\" data-discover=\"true\">Quero conhecer <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"section bento-grid\"><div class=\"bento-card blue bento-1\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.162481px);\"><div class=\"bento-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-fingerprint\"><path d=\"M12 10a2 2 0 0 0-2 2c0 1.02-.1 2.51-.26 4\"></path><path d=\"M14 13.12c0 2.38 0 6.38-1 8.88\"></path><path d=\"M17.29 21.02c.12-.6.43-2.3.5-3.02\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a10 10 0 0 1 18-6\"></path><path d=\"M2 16h.01\"></path><path d=\"M21.8 16c.2-2 .131-5.354 0-6\"></path><path d=\"M5 19.5C5.5 18 6 15 6 12a6 6 0 0 1 .34-2\"></path><path d=\"M8.65 22c.21-.66.45-1.32.57-2\"></path><path d=\"M9 6.8a6 6 0 0 1 9 5.2v2\"></path></svg></div><img class=\"bento-mockup\" src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/security-card-01.png.webp\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"eager\"><span>01</span><h3>Confirmação de identidade</h3><p>Ações importantes pedem a confirmação certa.</p><div class=\"bento-signal\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class=\"bento-card gold bento-2\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.420777px);\"><div class=\"bento-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bell-ring\"><path d=\"M10.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 3.464 0\"></path><path d=\"M22 8c0-2.3-.8-4.3-2-6\"></path><path d=\"M3.262 15.326A1 1 0 0 0 4 17h16a1 1 0 0 0 .74-1.673C19.41 13.956 18 12.499 18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 4.499-1.411 5.956-2.738 7.326\"></path><path d=\"M4 2C2.8 3.7 2 5.7 2 8\"></path></svg></div><img class=\"bento-mockup\" src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/security-card-02.png.webp\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"eager\"><span>02</span><h3>Alertas contextuais</h3><p>Informação rápida quando uma movimentação acontece.</p></div><div class=\"bento-card mint bento-3\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.927106px);\"><div class=\"bento-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock-keyhole\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"16\" r=\"1\"></circle><rect x=\"3\" y=\"10\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 10V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v3\"></path></svg></div><img class=\"bento-mockup\" src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/security-card-03.png.webp\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"eager\"><span>03</span><h3>Controle de acesso</h3><p>Gerencie acesso e recursos de segurança pelo ambiente digital.</p></div><div class=\"bento-card coral bento-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(1.85172px);\"><div class=\"bento-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle\"><path d=\"M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z\"></path></svg></div><img class=\"bento-mockup\" src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/security-card-04.png.webp\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"eager\"><span>04</span><h3>Comunicação direta</h3><p>Orientações objetivas para situações que exigem atenção.</p></div></section><section class=\"campaign-banner banner-mint is-reverse\" data-cm-section=\"original-3\"><div class=\"campaign-photo\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.286703px);\"><img src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/security-campaign-relatable-v2.webp.webp\" alt=\"Mulher brasileira em casa, representando cuidado com a seguran\\u00e7a digital\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" loading=\"eager\" data-cm-image=\"true\"></div><div class=\"campaign-copy\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.286703px);\"><p class=\"eyebrow light\"><span></span> SEGURANÇA TAMBÉM É PROXIMIDADE</p><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Informação que chega.<br>Cuidado que permanece.</h2><p data-cm-text=\"true\">A proteção fica mais forte quando você entende o que está acontecendo e sabe qual é o próximo passo.</p><a class=\"button button-light\" href=\"/ajuda\" data-discover=\"true\">Ver orientações<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"campaign-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C+</div></div></section><section class=\"section safety-guide\" data-cm-section=\"original-4\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.286703px);\"><p class=\"eyebrow dark\"><span></span> PAUSA QUE PROTEGE</p><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Desconfie. Confira. Só então confirme.</h2></div><div class=\"safety-grid\"><article><b>01</b><h3>Nunca compartilhe códigos</h3><p>Senhas e códigos de confirmação são pessoais.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Confira o destino</h3><p>Revise nomes e valores antes de concluir.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Use canais oficiais</h3><p>Em dúvida, pare a ação e procure ajuda.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"info-band\" data-cm-section=\"original-5\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.477472px);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock-keyhole\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"16\" r=\"1\"></circle><rect x=\"3\" y=\"10\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 10V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v3\"></path></svg><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Cuidado também é autonomia.</h2><p data-cm-text=\"true\">Quanto mais clara a informação, mais segura pode ser a sua decisão.</p><a href=\"/ajuda\" data-discover=\"true\">Saiba mais <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"section faq-section compact\" data-cm-section=\"original-6\"><div class=\"faq-intro\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.635328px);\"><p class=\"eyebrow dark\"><span></span> PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES</p><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Perguntas de segurança</h2></div><div class=\"faq-support\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(2.06686px);\"><span class=\"faq-support-mark\">?</span><div><b>Ainda ficou com dúvida?</b><p data-cm-text=\"true\">Fale com a equipe e encontre o próximo passo para o seu momento.</p><a href=\"/ajuda#contato\" data-discover=\"true\">Falar com a equipe <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-list\"><details open=\"\"><summary><span>01</span>A CredMaisPay pede minha senha por mensagem?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p>Não compartilhe senhas ou códigos por mensagens. Canais legítimos não devem solicitar suas credenciais completas.</p></details><details><summary><span>02</span>O que fazer diante de uma movimentação desconhecida?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p>Use os controles disponíveis e procure imediatamente o canal de atendimento apresentado no ambiente oficial.</p></details><details><summary><span>03</span>Como identificar um contato confiável?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p>Acesse sempre o site ou aplicativo diretamente, sem usar links recebidos de origem desconhecida.</p></details></div></section><section class=\"closing-cta\" data-cm-section=\"original-7\"><div class=\"cta-orb orb-a\"></div><div class=\"cta-orb orb-b\"></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.635328px);\"><p class=\"eyebrow light\"><span></span> SEGURANÇA CREDMAISPAY</p><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Proteção para seguir.<br><em>com autonomia.</em></h2><p data-cm-text=\"true\">Informação clara e recursos para você reconhecer cada movimento com confiança.</p><a class=\"button button-gold\" href=\"/ajuda\" data-discover=\"true\">Ver orientações <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-lead\"><div><p